github-ninja bundles skills copied from these upstream repositories. Each copied skill folder
keeps the upstream licence as LICENSE.txt. The exact upstream commit of each skill is in its
SKILL.md under metadata.upstream (kept current by .github/workflows/upstream-sync.yml).

