Local changes to copied skills: a `metadata` block (version, upstream) added to each SKILL.md
frontmatter, and tool version pins from skill-pins.json (scripts/pins.py), currently:
  skills/gh-attach/SKILL.md: `gh extension install sudosubin/gh-attach` gets `--pin <tag>`.
Any further local edit is listed here.
